#001L
//// Frequency ////

[] Usable frequency coverage:
                                           -+
   IC-F320    L-band type   136 to 155 MHz  |
              H-band type   146 to 174 MHz  | in 5 kHz,6.25 kHz
                                            | or 7.5 kHz steps
   IC-F420    L-band type   400 to 430 MHz  | only
              ML-band type  450 to 470 MHz  |
              MH-band type  470 to 490 MHz  |
              H-band type   490 to 512 MHz  |
                                           -+

[] Wide/Narrow selection

  Each channel can be set to wide/narrow for both receive
   IF bandwidth and transmitter modulation.  Note that
   this capability is not available for some versions.

  Push [Backspace] to select bandwidth when Rx frequency
   is entered.
   * "n" appears between Rx frequency and Tx frequency,
     when the narrow width is selected.

RELATED SETTING
------------+-----------------------------------------------
Wide/Narrow | Key Assign screen.
------------+-----------------------------------------------


[] NOTES:

  "Transmit inhibit" is available by pushing [Space].

  When no receive frequency is entered, other data
     cannot be programmed in the line.

  "<-" in the transmit column indicates simplex.
