#013P
//// Log IN/OFF ////

ID code is transmitted in relation to the PTT switch.
------------+-----------------------------------------------
OFF         | No ID is transmitted with the [PTT].
------------+-----------------------------------------------
Log IN      | ID is transmitted each time [PTT] is pushed.
------------+-----------------------------------------------
Log IN at   | ID is transmitted when [PTT] is pushed
 Inaudible  | in "Inaudible" mode.
            | *Voice transmission is impossible when
            |  "Inaudible" mode is selected.
------------+-----------------------------------------------
Log OFF     | ID is transmitted each time [PTT] is released.
------------+-----------------------------------------------
Log OFF at  | ID is transmitted when [PTT] is released
 inaudible  | in "Inaudible" mode.
            | *Voice transmission is impossible when
            |  "Inaudible" mode is selected.
------------+-----------------------------------------------
Both Log IN | ID is transmitted each time PTT is pushed and
 and Log OFF| released.
------------+-----------------------------------------------



RELATED SETTINGS:
----------------+-------------------------------------------
ID code setting | Code assign: in this screen.
                | Code contents: TX Code CH screen.
----------------+-------------------------------------------
SW action PTT   | in this screen
                |  *When "Audible" is selected, setting to
                |   "at Inaudible" in this item does not
                |   function.
----------------+-------------------------------------------
TOT ID out      | Common screen (lower left)
----------------+-------------------------------------------
