#014L
//// Auto Reset ////

The transceiver restarts the PWR ON Scan for specified time (Timer A
or Timer B) after signal disappears or key operation is finished.

NOTE: To turn OFF the auto reset function, set the timer (Time A
      or Time B) to OFF (set to 0 sec.) in the Common screen.

RELATED SETTINGS:
