The set text or received ID code appears when a matched
5-tone code is received.

Input the desired text using the following letters
or push [Space] to select the ID decode function.


       ** USABLE CHARACTERS                      **
       **                                        **
       **     A to Z (upper- and lowercase)      **
       **     0 to 9                             **
       **     $ % ' ( ) * + , - / < = > ? @      **
       **     [ \ ] ^ _ ` { | } ~                **
       **     ":" = transmit mark (upper arrow)  **
       **     ";" = receive mark  (lower arrow)  **
       **                                        **

NOTES:
1.Some lowercase letters may be difficult to read on the transceiver's
  display.

2.The programmable character generator's character can not be used for
  the 1st and 2nd text letters. (See Expert screen; Character Editor)
  In such cases no character appears in the above positions.




