#064
//// TX Code ////

Prepare the transmit 5-tone codes for assignment to each
operating channel's station, ID and repeater codes.


USABLE KEYS: [0] to [9], [A] to [E]
             and group code ([G] or [*])



TX code channels 29 to 32 are used for station codes when
the following operation is performed:

[] CH 32 : when [Moni] key has reset code 1 (32) capability
[] CH 31 : when [Moni] key has reset code 2 (31) capability
[] CH 30 : when [Call A] key is pushed.
[] CH 29 : when [Call B] key is pushed.
