When the [Tx Code Enter] function is assigned to the
transceiver, a transmit code can be input manually.  In this
case, set the allowable digits for input using this item.



SETTING METHOD:
  Push a digit key (1-7) to toggle the corresponding input
  digit ON and OFF.
   * Indicated numbers mean key entry accept;
     non-indicated numbers mean key entry inhibit.
